  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "fcrepo4/ontology",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " repository contains a lot of non-core (extension) ontologies. These extension ontologies should be extracted into their own repositories and out of the ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "fcrepo4",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " organization. Ontologies to be moved include:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "audit.rdf -> fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-audit-ontology/",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "indexing.rdf -> fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-indexing-ontology/",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "oai-pmh.rdf -> fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-oai-pmh-ontology/",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "objState.rdf -> fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-object-state-ontology/",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "ldp-fedora-mapping.rdf (is this even used? perhaps it can simply be removed: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "accessLevel": "",
        "id": "557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0",
        "text": "@A. Soroka"
       },
       "type": "mention"
      },
      {
       "text": " would know)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "attrs": {
        "accessLevel": "",
        "id": "557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0",
        "text": "@A. Soroka"
       },
       "type": "mention"
      },
      {
       "text": ", ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "accessLevel": "",
        "id": "60785ded115da6006f540529",
        "text": "@Andrew Woods"
       },
       "type": "mention"
      },
      {
       "text": " do you agree with the above reorganization?",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
