      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>OK, I created a ticket for the ldp-fedora-mapping ontology: <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1749\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1749</a></p>\n\n<p>I will limit my efforts on this ticket to audit, indexing and oai-pmh.</p>",
     "created": "25/Sep/15 11:28 AM",
     "id": "15323",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/11702/comment/15323",
