  "description": "<p>The <tt>fcrepo4/ontology</tt> repository contains a lot of non-core (extension) ontologies. These extension ontologies should be extracted into their own repositories and out of the <tt>fcrepo4</tt> organization. Ontologies to be moved include:</p>\n\n<p>audit.rdf -&gt; fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-audit-ontology/<br/>\nindexing.rdf -&gt; fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-indexing-ontology/<br/>\noai-pmh.rdf -&gt; fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-oai-pmh-ontology/<br/>\nobjState.rdf -&gt; fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-object-state-ontology/<br/>\nldp-fedora-mapping.rdf (is this even used? perhaps it can simply be removed: <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" data-account-id=\"557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" accountid=\"557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" rel=\"noreferrer\">A. Soroka</a> would know)</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" data-account-id=\"557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" accountid=\"557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" rel=\"noreferrer\">A. Soroka</a>, <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" data-account-id=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" accountid=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Andrew Woods</a> do you agree with the above reorganization?</p>",
